# CF-drive stores application configuration in D1 after owner-signed setup.
# Do not put application passwords or signing keys in this file.
# The local owner private key is generated under .cf-drive/ and is ignored by Git.
# For local testing of controller-to-node enrollment, add a unique value locally:
# NODE_CREDENTIAL_KEK="replace-with-a-random-32-byte-or-longer-secret"
